    "original_url": "https://radiodalsan.com/2026/08/16/jeexjeexyada-maqaarka-yaa-ku-dhaca-ma-la-daaweyn-karaa/?utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=jeexjeexyada-maqaarka-yaa-ku-dhaca-ma-la-daaweyn-karaa",
    "country": "Somalia",
